  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PHL_PRF towards SDS SEA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEMSEA Resource Facility (PRF) provides technical and secretariat services to PEMSEA to support country and non-country partners and networks of local governments and learning centres implement SDS-SEA which is aligned to global goals and regional commitments. This project provides annual support for the PRF staff salary and operational costs as well as governance meetings to monitor, calibrate and provide strategic directions on PEMSEA&#x2019;s work.</narrative>
  </description>
